// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Sym         2
#define Fun         3
#define Game        4
#define Gameplus    5

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos { compatible = "zmk,combos"; };

    macros {
        hangul: hangul {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&none>, <&macro_press>;

            label = "HANGUL";
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
              &kp Q       &kp W       &kp E          &kp R         &kp T          &kp Y    &kp U        &kp I               &kp O           &kp P
              &hm LGUI A  &hm LALT S  &hm LCTRL D    &hm LSHIFT F  &kp G          &kp H    &hm RSHFT J  &hm LEFT_CONTROL K  &hm LEFT_ALT L  &hm LEFT_GUI SEMICOLON
&lt 3 ESCAPE  &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C          &kp V         &kp B          &kp N    &kp M        &kp COMMA           &kp DOT         &kp SLASH               &kp LC(LS(LA(LG(Z))))
                                      &mt LCTRL DEL  &lt 1 TAB     &lt 1 SPACE    &kp RET  &lt 2 BSPC   &kp DELETE
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
              &kp TILDE       &trans     &kp UP_ARROW  &trans     &kp LG(LEFT_ARROW)    &kp RBRC        &mkp MB4        &mmv MOVE_UP    &mkp MB5         &kp NUMBER_0
              &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LEFT   &kp DOWN      &kp RIGHT  &kp LG(UP_ARROW)      &msc SCRL_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &msc SCRL_RIGHT
&kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LEFT_WIN    &kp MINUS  &trans        &kp PLUS   &kp LPAR              &kp RPAR        &msc SCRL_UP    &msc SCRL_DOWN  &mkp MB3         &kp KP_MULTIPLY  &kp PLUS
                                         &trans        &trans     &trans                &mkp MB1        &mkp MB2        &mkp MB3
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            display-name = "Sym";
            bindings = <
                &kp EXCL  &kp AT  &kp HASH  &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERCENT    &kp CARET  &kp AMPERSAND  &kp KP_ASTERISK  &kp SQT  &kp DQT
                &trans    &trans  &trans    &trans      &trans         &trans     &trans         &trans           &trans   &trans
&studio_unlock  &trans    &trans  &trans    &trans      &trans         &kp UNDER  &kp EQUAL      &trans           &trans   &kp SLASH  &kp HOME
                                  &trans    &trans      &trans         &trans     &trans         &trans
            >;
        };

        Fun {
            display-name = "Fun";
            bindings = <
        &bootloader  &trans  &trans  &trans  &to 4     &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp END  &kp F1
        &trans       &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans   &kp F10
&trans  &trans       &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans   &kp F20  &kp F7
                             &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            display-name = "Game";
            bindings = <
            &kp Z           &kp X  &kp C      &kp V         &sl 5     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
            &kp TAB         &kp Q  &kp W      &kp E         &kp R     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp ESCAPE  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp A  &kp S      &kp D         &kp F     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                   &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming+ {
            display-name = "Game+";
            bindings = <
        &kp F10  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp T     &kp RA(RC(Y))  &kp RA(RC(U))  &trans  &trans  &kp LC(RA(DEL))
        &kp L    &kp O         &kp Y         &kp K         &kp G     &kp F5         &kp F7         &trans  &trans  &kp F12
&trans  &to 0    &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans    &trans         &trans         &trans  &trans  &kp F22          &kp LA(F4)
                               &kp J         &kp I         &kp M     &trans         &trans         &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
